    <string id="sg_friendlyduel_request_option" text="常言道：“文无第一，武无第二。”今愿与君一试高下，可否赏脸赐教？" />
    <string id="sg_friendlyduel_request_refuse" text="匹夫之勇，恕不奉陪。" />
    <string id="sg_friendlyduel_request_accept" text="正有此意，放马过来！" />
    <string id="sg_friendlyduel_request_won" text="阁下武艺精妙绝伦，今日得以一战，实乃三生有幸。" />
    <string id="sg_friendlyduel_request_lose" text="承让承让，今日侥幸获胜，实乃英雄手下留情。" />
    <string id="sg_friendlyduel_dialog_title" text="比试：" />
    <string id="sg_friendlyduel_dialog_desc" text="请选择比试方式：" />
    <string id="sg_friendlyduel_dialog_nohorse" text="步战" />
    <string id="sg_friendlyduel_dialog_horse" text="马战" />
